# a sin said plainly, the count a run ends on, where its checklist is, and a run that could not read everything
^(?:\S+, line \d+:|\d+ sins? in \d+ files?$|[✓✗⚠] |↳ checklist written to )
progress: ^(?:parsing|reading|detector) (\d+)/(\d+)$
label: Judging the project against its commandments
commands: commandments judge
finished: ^(?:\d+ sins? in \d+ files?$|✓ |↳ checklist written to )
failed: ^(?:✗ |⚠ )
summary: ^(\d+ sins? across \d+ skills?\.|✓ .+)$
